      "body": "## SOTE Work Ticket\n\n**Requested by:** Prof Rinsem  \n**Assigned operator(s):** Zack, Mobina  \n**Category:** Infrastructure  \n**Priority:** Low  \n**Zone / location:** Rocket's Engineering Bay\n\n### Request / Scope\nRun a complete validation and evaluation of the \"data center\" equipment currently located in Rocket's Forge. Document all findings and determine next steps for this equipment. Locate the additional equipment in the NOC and inventory together.\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\nInventory documentation completed and future use case described\n\n### Work Log\nUse comments for CHECKPOINT, BLOCKED, READY FOR VALIDATION, and READY FOR REVIEW updates.\n\n---\nCreated through the SOTE Operator Ticket Console.",
